<EnglishPolicyLayout title="Accessibility Statement" description="Accessibility features on the Heart Compass website and how to report a difficulty or request an adjustment." path="accessibility" updated="5 November 2026">
  <p>Heart Compass values making its services available to everyone, including people with disabilities. We continuously work to improve website accessibility and make it as convenient to use as possible.</p>
  <section>
    <h2>Accessibility standard</h2>
    <p>The website aims to meet WCAG 2.0 Level AA, with support for commonly used browsers and keyboard navigation wherever possible.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Accessibility features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>An accessibility menu on the left edge of the screen with text resizing, high contrast, grayscale, link highlighting, and animation controls.</li>
      <li>A “Skip to main content” link for keyboard users.</li>
      <li>A structured heading hierarchy.</li>
      <li>Keyboard navigation (Tab, Enter, and Escape) in menu and panel controls.</li>
      <li>Accessible labels for icon buttons.</li>
      <li>Alternative text for website images.</li>
      <li>English accessibility controls on English pages and Hebrew controls on Hebrew pages.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Possible limitations</h2>
    <p>Despite our efforts, some content or components may not be fully accessible. If you encounter a difficulty, please contact us so we can address it as soon as possible.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Accessibility contact</h2>
    <p>Yossi Medalsi is the accessibility contact for Heart Compass. To report a problem or request an adjustment, contact him directly:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+972544580285">+972 54 458 0285</a></li>
      <li>Email: <a href="mailto:yossi@heartcompass.co.il">yossi@heartcompass.co.il</a></li>
      <li>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/972544580285" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+972 54 458 0285</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</EnglishPolicyLayout>
